        "Description": "Good evening 47. Today you can go to Marrakesh. Targets include, for example, Lasse Braun Hansson. He is a Danish archivist, and an important decision-maker at the city hall. Then last but not least, Jakob Ringholm. Jakob is one of the main bosses, and is one of the people who has started this campaign of environmental destruction. Hitman, now properly then. be the best. Good luck, and as always... Have fun!",
